  "text": "SDK2Changer - Free CS2 Skinchanger | SDK2Changer - NinjaChanger Download SDK2Changer\n\n4.0 Total marks amount: 491 Modification is outdated\n\nAvailable versions for this mod: SDK2Changer, NinjaChanger. The first public skin changer with wallhack functionality for Counter-Strike 2. Created to help other developers build mods for CS2. It is a trailblazing tool that introduces advanced features for enhancing gameplay while offering valuable insights for modders. This modification has set a new benchmark for how mods can integrate with CS2, paving the way for future innovations. bruhmoment21\n\nAuthor bruhmoment21 Release date 11 September 2023 Latest update date 23 March 2024 Downloads 69 850 Launches 275 441 Other information On the mod card in the ExLoader app\n\nLaunch guide/advices You can and you probably WILL BE banned by VAC for using this mod! So please, use it only on your second account and only with VAC-Bypass feature that can be used with the shield icon next to mod's launch button. Gloves are not working and non-default knives have broken animations! CFG system is not implemented yet :c. Popular functions in this mod Skinchanger - changes your skins and models InventoryChanger - adds skins to your inventory",
